{"id":"7820ef81342beb1d","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-preserved.md","title":"Preservation along a Transfer Relation","display":"df-preserved — Preservation along a Transfer Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-preserved","aliases":["17-df-preserved"],"display":"df-preserved — Preservation along a Transfer Relation","depends_on":["[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-sentence-truth]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-preserved"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-preserved</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-preserved — Preservation along a Transfer Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (truth of sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是固定一阶语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为结构对的可定义元类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\times\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\times\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>。对结构与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的量化均属 ZFC 元语言，集合值算子返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 的子集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Preserved}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Preserved}_L\\)</span> (operator defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Preserved}_L(R)\n=\n\\Bigl\\{\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\n\\forall(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B})\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma\n\\to\n\\mathfrak{B}\\models\\sigma\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Preserved}_L(R)\n=\n\\Bigl\\{\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\n\\forall(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B})\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma\n\\to\n\\mathfrak{B}\\models\\sigma\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Binary preservation theorems instantiate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> with extension, homomorphism,\nor another explicitly defined pairwise transfer relation. Whole-chain unions\nand indexed reduced products use their dedicated preservation predicates.\nThe construction name and the relation are no longer conflated as one untyped\nparameter.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ ($L$-sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ ($L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models$ (truth of sentences, see [[17-df-sentence-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\times\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Preserved}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Preserved}_L(R)\n=\n\\Bigl\\{\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\n\\forall(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B})\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak{A}\\models\\sigma\n\\to\n\\mathfrak{B}\\models\\sigma\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1636,"backlinks":[{"id":"105ca7a585f377f9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书印刷 p.147（DjVu 163）先定义理论的保持性。本库已有的 [[17-df-preserved]] 与 [[17-df-chain-union-preservation]] 接收单个句子，不能直接接收理论。理论层的链保持性也不能改写成每个原公理分别具有单句保持性：各阶段须同时满足整个理论。这里只补缺少的参数接口，不重复已有句子定义。原书采用序数指标；非空线序表述与原书在一阶理论上的结论一致，前向由有限见证论证，逆向可限制到序数链。"},{"id":"7b8a12056c44415b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Preserved}_L$ (preservation operator, see [[17-df-preserved]])"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valu